      "body": "Users need clear integration instructions beyond the basic README quickstart.\n\n## Changes\n\n- **Created `docs/integration-guide.md`** (813 lines)\n  - Prerequisites: Node.js versions, browser requirements, FIDO2 authenticator options\n  - Three integration paths:\n    - Standalone application (clone → install → deploy)\n    - React app integration (component copy, import patterns)\n    - Vanilla JS implementation (no-framework approach with axios)\n  - Component API reference: `CryptoSparks`, `useCryptoMomentum`, `Dashboard`, `LoginFIDO2`\n  - Environment variables and CoinGecko API rate limit configuration\n  - Troubleshooting matrix for common setup issues\n  - Deployment recipes for Vercel, Netlify, GitHub Pages\n\n- **Updated navigation**\n  - Added \"Getting Started\" section in `docs/index.md`\n  - Linked integration guide from README quick start section\n\n- **Build artifact cleanup**\n  - Added `package-lock.json` to `.gitignore` (aligns with repo convention)\n\n## Example Usage\n\n```javascript\n// React integration\nimport CryptoSparks from './components/echoforge/CryptoSparks';\n\nfunction Portfolio() {\n  return (\n    <CryptoSparks \n      symbols={['bitcoin', 'ethereum', 'solana']}\n      pollingInterval={2500}\n    />\n  );\n}\n```\n\n```javascript\n// Vanilla JS integration\nasync function fetchCryptoMomentum(symbols) {\n  const response = await axios.get(\n    'https://api.coingecko.com/api/v3/coins/markets',\n    { params: { vs_currency: 'usd', ids: symbols.join(',') } }\n  );\n  return response.data.map(coin => ({\n    name: coin.name,\n    rm2e: calculateRM2E(coin)  // See guide for formula\n  }));\n}\n```\n\n<!-- START COPILOT CODING AGENT SUFFIX -->\n\n\n\n<!-- START COPILOT ORIGINAL PROMPT -->\n\n\n\n<details>\n\n<summary>Original prompt</summary>\n\n> step by step integration procedure. \n\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n<!-- START COPILOT CODING AGENT TIPS -->\n---\n\n💬 We'd love your input! Share your thoughts on Copilot coding agent in our [2 minute survey](https://gh.io/copilot-coding-agent-survey).\n",
